{"version":1,"content":"<p>80年代無綫（TVB）力捧花旦黃曼凝，1981年參與拍攝香港小姐宣傳片，其後正式簽約無線。</p><p>為無綫效力期間演出過不少作品，《戲班小子》、《十三太保》、《鱷魚潭》等，在《香城浪子》中更將月華一角演得活靈活現。</p><p>不過她演出古裝劇居多，當中最令人津津</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.871290+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143409+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143409+00:00","content_hash":"292d5671c25427be40e314f5dc956c9a1174d4298b7b83570dd3251c3d974e40","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}